  <p id="c-nanshi-027-kongjing-xiuzhi-ancestry:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-027-kongjing-xiuzhi-ancestry:p001:m0000" ref="f84_da6_42a_AA">孔靖</persName>字<persName id="c-nanshi-027-kongjing-xiuzhi-ancestry:p001:m0003" ref="f84_da6_42a_AA">季恭</persName>，會稽山陰人也，名與宋武帝祖諱同，故以字稱。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-027-kongjing-xiuzhi-ancestry:p001:m0028" ref="f84_da6_42a">愉</persName>，晉車騎將軍。父<persName id="c-nanshi-027-kongjing-xiuzhi-ancestry:p001:m0037" ref="f84_da6_42a_A">誾</persName>，散騎常侍。</p>
